WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Measurement and units. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Convert and report quantities clearly

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Units expose errors. Convert all quantities to compatible units before using a formula.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: 1,500 mm = 1.5 m; mixing mm and m without conversion makes a geometry result wrong by scale factors.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Error spotting

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Convert and report quantities clearly
